  "system_note": "The one code system membership is tested in. Synthea codes MedicationRequest in RxNorm at clinical-drug level -- its rheumatoid arthritis module orders RxNorm 105585, 'Methotrexate 2.5 MG Oral Tablet' -- so an ingredient-only set would load cleanly, compare cleanly and match nobody, which is the failure D52 named and D111 gave a mechanism (REQ-59).",
